  K = 1e9: n = 6.931e+10 answers = 3.466e+07 working years of 2000 h = 7.907e+06 calendar years
  certificate ln(20)/(theta delta) = 299.57  (ceil 300)
  pool of 1e4 people, one year each: K paid = 144.3 bits (proof file 6.2, row 3)
  20 sequential batches: K paid = 0.289 bits
  certificate pass prob, exact imitator, e = 0.0: (1-2e(1-e))^300 = 1
  certificate pass prob, exact imitator, e = 0.001: (1-2e(1-e))^300 = 0.549
  certificate pass prob, exact imitator, e = 0.01: (1-2e(1-e))^300 = 0.00248
  certificate pass prob, exact imitator, e = 0.1: (1-2e(1-e))^300 = 1.39e-26
