== Example 2.3 (caveat on A2)
  Pr[nu1 never refuted] = 0.556481; refuted = 0.443519; limit failure prob = 0.2218
  simulation of Protocol R, 200000 runs, n = 60: Pr[nu1 refuted] = 0.4424 +- 0.0022
  K1 =  1: Pr[nu1 refuted] = 0.4435  (bound 1-(4/5)^K1 = 0.2000)
  K1 =  2: Pr[nu1 refuted] = 0.6556  (bound 1-(4/5)^K1 = 0.3600)
  K1 =  5: Pr[nu1 refuted] = 0.9037  (bound 1-(4/5)^K1 = 0.6723)
  K1 = 10: Pr[nu1 refuted] = 0.9874  (bound 1-(4/5)^K1 = 0.8926)
  K1 = 20: Pr[nu1 refuted] = 0.9998  (bound 1-(4/5)^K1 = 0.9885)

