== Proposition 1.9a: cut and paste and subadditivity, random episodic scaffolds
  400 scaffolds: max |H2(Q_S,Q_T) - H2(Q_SnT,Q_SuT)| = 1.11e-16
  max of sqrt(H2(C,P)) - sum_i sqrt(H2(C,C[i<-P])) = 0.000e+00 (<= 0 claimed)
  max of H2 - (L_e/2) sum KL = -4.427e-03 (<= 0 claimed); for L_e = 2, max of H2 - sum KL = -5.726e-02
